			"notes": "- added 2 new captchas\n  - Sponsor: You're shown an ad you need to skip after waiting for a few seconds (time increases based on difficulty) if you click the ad instead of the skip button, you \"download\" unwanted addons that affect your screen for a while.\n  - Journey of Slime: Get to the other side without being squished by trains or drowning in rivers. Difficulty affects speed and frequency of both trains and logs, as well as the length of the map.\n- added more config options, mainly for dis-//enabling specific sources of captchas\n- added yayConfig (access via `/captcha config` or `/yayconfig captcha:world`)\n- added reward loot table\n  - empty per default, you can use datapacks to customize it\n- added cap to visual gambling coins\n- added more config options (mainly for en-//disabling sources of captchas)\n- added commands to set, reset and check both global (server-wide) and local (of specific players) captcha difficulty\n- fixed issue that caused certain captchas to completely break when started at a too low difficultyunexpectedly)triggered using a command\n- added config entry to dis-//enable reward loot tables more easily\n- improved flow of loot containers being locked behind captchas\n  - the loot container is now automatically openend after the captcha is completed successfully"
		},
